-- Rules of Court 2021 (Singapore), G.N. No. S 914/2021, current version as at 5 November 2026.
-- ORDER 46A: EXPRESS TRACK FOR ACTIONS IN GENERAL DIVISION (lines 6128 to 6174 of the text).  LAYER 1.
-- Source: a plain-text rendering made by a converter script from Singapore Statutes Online.
-- It is not the official text, and nothing here has been checked against the official text.
--
-- HOW TO READ A RESULT.  Decision functions answer `MAYBE BOOLEAN`.
--   JUST TRUE    the text says yes on these facts.
--   JUST FALSE   the text says no in its own words (a flat negative, a "where"/"if"/"unless" not met,
--                a period or limit the text fixes in its own words, a "means" definition).
--   NOTHING      the text does not answer (a power or scope limited by its own wording, a bare "must" not done).
-- O 3 r 2(1) is a caveat on every answer (the Court may order otherwise in the interests of justice).
-- PERIODS.  Each period is a `Period` constant named for its section.  It is counted under O 3 r 3 (lines 323 to
-- 329): a period "after" a date begins immediately after it (r 3(3)); a period "before" a date ends immediately
-- before it (r 3(4)); a month is a calendar month (r 3(2)); a period that expires on a non-court day runs to the
-- next court day (r 3(7)).  The LAST DAY is the seam input `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act` (PLAN.md S-T1).

