-- JUDGMENT QB | O 46A r 2(a) | NOTHING when the pleading is not accompanied by a list and a copy of every document relied on | JUST FALSE for the compliance question, with consequence functions staying NOTHING
@ref O 46A r 2(a) (src:6143-6144)
